<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Komi Tic-Tac-Toe</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: #202020; background: #fafafa; }
        main { max-width: 28rem; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
        p { line-height: 1.5; }
        #status { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold; }
        #board { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: .5rem; max-width: 20rem; }
        button { font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
        #board button { aspect-ratio: 1; font-size: 2.5rem; border: 2px solid #666; border-radius: .25rem; background: white; color: #202020; }
        #board button:disabled { cursor: default; background: #ececec; opacity: 1; }
        button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #145bcc; outline-offset: 3px; }
        #play-again { margin-top: 1rem; padding: .6rem 1rem; }
    </style>
    <script src="game.js" defer></script>
    <script src="app.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <h1>Komi Tic-Tac-Toe</h1>
        <p>Two players share this board. X starts. If the board fills without three in a row, O wins the Komi tiebreak.</p>
        <p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
        <div id="board" role="group" aria-label="Tic-tac-toe board">
            <button type="button" data-index="0" aria-label="Row 1, column 1, empty"></button>
            <button type="button" data-index="1" aria-label="Row 1, column 2, empty"></button>
            <button type="button" data-index="2" aria-label="Row 1, column 3, empty"></button>
            <button type="button" data-index="3" aria-label="Row 2, column 1, empty"></button>
            <button type="button" data-index="4" aria-label="Row 2, column 2, empty"></button>
            <button type="button" data-index="5" aria-label="Row 2, column 3, empty"></button>
            <button type="button" data-index="6" aria-label="Row 3, column 1, empty"></button>
            <button type="button" data-index="7" aria-label="Row 3, column 2, empty"></button>
            <button type="button" data-index="8" aria-label="Row 3, column 3, empty"></button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="play-again" hidden>Play Again</button>
        <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to play.</p></noscript>
    </main>
</body>
</html>

